{"id":"fcf794bdb0764404","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-nonstandard-model.md","title":"Nonstandard Model Example","display":"ex-nonstandard-model — Nonstandard Model Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-nonstandard-model","aliases":["92-ex-nonstandard-model"],"display":"ex-nonstandard-model — Nonstandard Model Example","depends_on":["[[92-thm-compactness]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-nonstandard-model]]","[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-universal-closure]]","[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]"],"source":"本地模型论扩展；给定 PDF 不提供这个紧致性构造","source_status":"外部背景的本地例子"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-nonstandard-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-nonstandard-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-nonstandard-model — Nonstandard Model Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a9a64dce00ebd76\" href=\"?note=1a9a64dce00ebd76\" title=\"92-thm-compactness\">92-thm-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" href=\"?note=47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" title=\"92-df-nonstandard-model\">92-df-nonstandard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"302b3328b775d21b\" href=\"?note=302b3328b775d21b\" title=\"92-df-universal-closure\">92-df-universal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地模型论扩展；给定 PDF 不提供这个紧致性构造"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景的本地例子"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano Arithmetic axioms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_G(\\bar n)\">\\(\\iota_G(\\bar n)\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (new constant symbol)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;\">\\(L&#39;\\)</span> (the expansion of the fixed arithmetic language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_G\">\\(\\mathcal L_G\\)</span> by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G[a/c]\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G[a/c]\\)</span> (the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L&#39;\">\\(L&#39;\\)</span>-expansion interpreting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;},\\models_{L&#39;}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;},\\models_{L&#39;}\\)</span> (the language-indexed structure and satisfaction notions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonStd}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{NonStd}_G\\)</span> (nonstandard-model predicate on the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_G\">\\(\\mathcal L_G\\)</span>-reduct, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" href=\"?note=47757ea7c4cfcbd4\" title=\"92-df-nonstandard-model\">92-df-nonstandard-model</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> 是开放 PA 公理的全称闭包，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"302b3328b775d21b\" href=\"?note=302b3328b775d21b\" title=\"92-df-universal-closure\">92-df-universal-closure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nL&#39;&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_G[c]\\quad(a_F(c)=0),\\\\\nT_c&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_G[\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]]\\cup\\{c\\neq\\iota_G(\\bar n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall F\\in[T_c]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G[a/c]\\models_{L&#39;}F),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathfrak M&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M&#39;\\models_{L&#39;}T_c\\land\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_G)\\land\nc^{\\mathfrak M&#39;}\\notin\\{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M&#39;}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nL&#39;&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_G[c]\\quad(a_F(c)=0),\\\\\nT_c&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota_G[\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]]\\cup\\{c\\neq\\iota_G(\\bar n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall F\\in[T_c]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G[a/c]\\models_{L&#39;}F),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists\\mathfrak M&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L&#39;}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M&#39;\\models_{L&#39;}T_c\\land\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(\\mathfrak M&#39;\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_G)\\land\nc^{\\mathfrak M&#39;}\\notin\\{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M&#39;}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>非标准模型构造示例</li>\n<li>由紧致性定理，存在PA的非标准模型</li>\n<li>每个有限子集只禁止<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>等于有限多个numeral，可在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span>中选择另一个自然数解释<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>；紧致性随后给出不等于任何标准numeral的元素</li>\n<li>这里用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\neq\\bar n\">\\(c\\neq\\bar n\\)</span>而非未定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\">\\(&gt;\\)</span>，已经足以保证算术语言约化不是标准模型</li>\n<li>非标准模型使不完备性有模型论视角</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\gamma\\)</span>相容，则完备性给出令相应独立句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span>为假的非标准模型；这一结论需要相容性前提</li>\n</ul>\n<p>语言、有限树公式、语义和约化见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a>。数项在新语言中的使用均指解析翻译 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_G(\\bar n)\">\\(\\iota_G(\\bar n)\\)</span>；算术结构约化后以相同解释数据读回本地 G 结构。紧致性使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1a9a64dce00ebd76\" href=\"?note=1a9a64dce00ebd76\" title=\"92-thm-compactness\">92-thm-compactness</a>的任意语言版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"1a9a64dce00ebd76","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-nonstandard-model","status":"resolved","id":"47757ea7c4cfcbd4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-nonstandard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"302b3328b775d21b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N_G$ (standard model, see [[92-df-standard-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"8