false},{"tex":"L'","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'},\\models_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonStd}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nL'&\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_G[c]\\quad(a_F(c)=0),\\\\\nT_c&\\coloneqq\\iota_G[\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]]\\cup\\{c\\neq\\iota_G(\\bar n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n&\\forall F\\in[T_c]^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G[a/c]\\models_{L'}F),\\\\\n&\\exists\\mathfrak M'\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M'\\models_{L'}T_c\\land\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(\\mathfrak M'\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_G)\\land\nc^{\\mathfrak M'}\\notin\\{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M'}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"c\\neq\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":">","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_G(\\bar n)","display":false}],"bytes":2770,"backlinks":[{"id":"8757635b793ed303","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是把[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]的扩张语言构造与紧致性定理合并后的推论；原式把仅是公理集的$\\mathrm{PA}$误当成了$\\mathrm{Con}$所接收的形式系统"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-383","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]"}],"o